<section class="page"><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT THE PROJECT</p><h1>A better home for stories.</h1><div class="panel"><p>Q8Flix V2 brings movies and TV series into a stable catalog with source choices, a watchlist, and honest viewing history.</p><p>Metadata is provided by TMDB where configured. This product uses the TMDB API but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB. Source availability and content rights are separate from metadata.</p><p>Only access providers and media you are authorized to use.</p></div></section>
